/**
 * The names of places, over the map.
 *
 * GENERATED by tools/worldmap/make_labels.py from the content's maps/labels.txt - do
 * not hand-edit; add the place THERE and regenerate. MapWindowTest runs the generator
 * again with --check when the content repo is beside this one, so a place added there
 * and not here is a failing test rather than a label nobody can see.
 *
 * A SLASH IN A NAME IS A LINE BREAK, which is how "Kingdom Of/Misthalin" sits over a
 * kingdom without covering it. {@link #lines} is the only thing that knows that.
 *
 * RANK IS HOW BIG A THING IS - 2 a kingdom or an island, 1 a town, 0 a landmark - and
 * it is what decides which labels a zoom is worth showing. All of them at once, on a
 * view of the whole county, is not a map.
 */
